---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const faqs = [
  { q: 'How much is a Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard?', a: 'It typically costs about $3.99 for a Mini, $4.79 for a Small, $5.79 for a Medium and $6.49 for a Large. Prices vary by location.' },
  { q: 'What is in the Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard?', a: 'Brownie pieces, chocolate chunks and cocoa fudge blended into DQ vanilla soft serve.' },
  { q: 'How many calories are in a Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard?', a: 'About 330 calories for a Mini, 510 for a Small, 710 for a Medium and 1,060 for a Large.' },
  { q: 'What is the difference between Choco Brownie Extreme and Brownie Batter?', a: 'Choco Brownie Extreme has chewy baked brownie pieces and tastes more like dark chocolate. Brownie Batter has soft, sweeter batter-style pieces.' },
  { q: 'Is the Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard available all year?', a: 'Yes. It is one of Dairy Queen’s year-round Blizzard flavors.' },
];
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })),
};
---
<Layout title="DQ Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard: Price & Calories" description="Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard prices: Mini $3.99, Small $4.79, Medium $5.79, Large $6.49. Calories by size, what is in it and how it compares.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

<Breadcrumbs items={[{"name": "Home", "href": "/"}, {"name": "Menu", "href": "/categories"}, {"name": "Blizzard Treats", "href": "/categories/blizzard-treats"}, {"name": "Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard"}]} />

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/choco-brownie-blizzard.webp" alt="Dairy Queen Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard with brownie pieces and fudge" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge">Year-round</span><span class="badge blue">Chocolate lovers</span></div>
      <h1>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</h1>
      <p class="quick-answer" style="margin:10px 0 14px;padding:12px 14px;background:#F0F9FF;border-left:4px solid #0E7490;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.55;color:#0B1E38;"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> A Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard at Dairy Queen costs about $3.99 for a Mini, $4.79 for a Small, $5.79 for a Medium and $6.49 for a Large. A Small has about 510 calories. It is on the menu year-round. Prices vary by location.</p>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $3.99</div>
      <p>This is the most chocolate you can get in one Blizzard: chewy brownie pieces, chocolate chunks and cocoa fudge blended into vanilla soft serve. It is richer and darker than most flavors, so many people find a Small is plenty.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Sizes</td><td>Mini · Small · Medium · Large</td></tr><tr><td>Starting price</td><td>$3.99 (Mini)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>510</td></tr><tr><td>Availability</td><td>Year-round</td></tr><tr><td>Allergens</td><td>Milk, Wheat, Soy <span style="display:block;font-size:.8rem;color:#64748B;">Shared equipment; check <a href="/blog/dq-gluten-free-allergen-guide">our allergen guide</a> and DQ’s official list.</span></td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Choco Brownie Extreme price and calories by size</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Mini</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~330</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Small</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.79</td><td>510</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Medium</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.79</td><td>~710</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Large</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.49</td><td>~1,060</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>What does it taste like?</h2>
    <p>Think of a brownie sundae blended into one cup. The brownie pieces are dense and chewy, the chocolate chunks add a little snap, and the fudge makes the whole thing taste like dark chocolate. It is less sweet than the <a href="/items/brownie-batter-blizzard">Brownie Batter Blizzard</a>, which uses softer batter-style pieces.</p>

    <h2>Should you order it?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Yes, if</strong> you always pick the most chocolatey dessert on the menu.</li>
      <li><strong>Try <a href="/items/brownie-batter-blizzard">Brownie Batter</a> instead</strong> if you want something sweeter and softer.</li>
      <li><strong>Try <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo</a> instead</strong> if you want chocolate with crunch and less richness.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How it compares to other chocolate Blizzards</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Mini price</th><th>Small calories</th><th>What it’s like</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Choco Brownie Extreme</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>510</td><td>Darkest chocolate, chewy brownie</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/items/brownie-batter-blizzard">Brownie Batter</a></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>530</td><td>Sweeter, softer batter pieces</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard">Cookie Dough</a></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>590</td><td>Soft cookie dough and fudge</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo</a></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>490</td><td>Cookie crunch with a fudge center</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>

    <h2>Ordering tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>New to it?</strong> Get a Mini first. It is rich.</li>
      <li><strong>Want even more chocolate?</strong> Ask for extra fudge or extra brownie pieces. There is usually a small charge.</li>
      <li><strong>Sharing?</strong> A Medium is about 710 calories and splits well between two people.</li>
      <li><strong>Want it as a cake?</strong> Many stores make Blizzard cakes in this flavor. See <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ cake sizes and prices</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">{f.q}<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">{f.a}</div></div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
